{"id":"716a4678ad674a84","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-2random-weak2.md","title":"2 随机性蕴含弱 2 随机性","display":"thm-2random-weak2 — 2 随机性蕴含弱 2 随机性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-thm-2random-weak2"],"display":"thm-2random-weak2 — 2 随机性蕴含弱 2 随机性","label":"43-thm-2random-weak2","type":"theorem","depends_on":["[[43-df-2random]]","[[43-df-weak2random]]","[[43-df-nrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.7 Theorem 9.7.3、Corollary 9.7.4，印刷190–191，PDF210–211；§10.5.1弱2讨论，印刷236–237，PDF256–257","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-2random-weak2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-2random-weak2 — 2 随机性蕴含弱 2 随机性"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-2random-weak2"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.7 Theorem 9.7.3、Corollary 9.7.4，印刷190–191，PDF210–211；§10.5.1弱2讨论，印刷236–237，PDF256–257"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_n\\)</span> 是由正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 索引的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上布尔谓词族，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}\">\\(\\mathrm{Weak2Random}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零测Π₂⁰类可用0′有效开集以任意指定误差外逼近，得到0′-ML检验。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.7 Theorem 9.7.3、Corollary 9.7.4，印刷190–191，PDF210–211；§10.5.1弱2讨论，印刷236–237，PDF256–257。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-2random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weak2random","status":"resolved","id":"1a145b88092ce22e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-weak2random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-2random]]、[[43-df-weak2random]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weak2random","status":"resolved","id":"1a145b88092ce22e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-2random]]、[[43-df-weak2random]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{Weak2Random}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-weak2random]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weak2random","status":"resolved","id":"1a145b88092ce22e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{Weak2Random}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-weak2random]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X).","display":true}],"bytes":1354,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-2random-weak2]] — 2 随机性蕴含弱 2 随机性"}],"outgoing":["c6460737e81fabbf","1a145b88092ce22e","86bdc33f83ee57a9"]}